public import MMP.Analysis.Complex.Coherent.OkaWeierstrassReduction

/-!
# The coherent analytic toolkit: coherence calculus, closure theorem, resolutions

Kernels, images and cokernels of coherent sheaves of modules, described through sections;
generation of a coherent sheaf of `𝒪_M`-modules near a point; relations among vectors of
holomorphic functions; the closure theorem for submodules of sections, from the Cauchy estimates
and Krull's intersection theorem; germs of relations at a point; and local finite free resolutions
of relation modules, from the regularity of the local ring of holomorphic germs.

## Main definitions

* `LocallyGenerates`: finitely many elements of a sheaf of modules over `Y` generate it locally
  over `Y`.
* `FinGen`: a sheaf of modules is locally generated by finitely many elements near every point.
* `RelFin`: the relations among finitely many elements of a sheaf of modules are locally finitely
  generated.
* `VecRel`: the relations among vectors of a fixed length of sections of a sheaf of rings are
  locally finitely generated.
* `krel`: the module of germs at `x` of the relations among finitely many elements.
* `IsRelResolution`: a finite free resolution of the relations among finitely many elements.

## Main results

* `isFiniteType_iff_finGen`: a sheaf of modules is of finite type if and only if it is locally
  finitely generated.
* `isCoherentModule_image`, `isCoherentModule_kernel`, `isCoherentModule_cokernel`: images and
  kernels of maps of coherent sheaves of modules are coherent, as are cokernels of maps from a
  sheaf of finite type to a coherent sheaf.
* `generation_near_point`: sections generating a coherent sheaf of `𝒪_M`-modules near `x` modulo
  coefficients vanishing at `x` generate it on a neighbourhood of `x`.
* `relFin_free_of_vecRel`: locally finitely generated relations among vectors give locally finitely
  generated relations in a free module of finite rank.
* `exists_eventuallyEq_sum_of_tendstoUniformlyOn`, `local_closure`: the closure theorem.
* `krel_eq_range`: the germs of relations are generated by the germs of generating relations.
* `exists_relResolution`: relations whose germs have projective dimension `≤ k` have, near `x`, a
  finite free resolution of length `≤ k`.
* `shortComplex_exact_of_locally`: a short complex of sheaves of modules which is locally exact on
  sections is exact.
-/

@[expose] public section

